// k3_hub_s32k388.repl — Renode platform for the K3 zonal hub. One line of
// substance: `using "platforms/cpus/nxp-s32k388.repl"` — the upstream
// Antmicro platform (verified in Renode master, July 2026): quad Cortex-M7
// (Zephyr runs on cpu0, cpu1-3 held in reset), 8 MB flash @ 0x00400000,
// SRAM @ 0x20400000, 16x LPUART (console lpuart2), 8x NXP_FlexCAN (can0-7).
// S32K344 is not modeled upstream, so ELFs built for mr_canhubk3/s32k344 run
// here — same family memory map. Write-up name: "S32K3-class (S32K388)";
// no NPU on S32K3 (hard rule).
